      "message": "Could the test have 2 parts: checking`ro.boot.flash.locked` against the host DT then booting a pVM and checking that the `avf` node isn\u0027t there in the guest DT? Otherwise, a faulty ABL could pass the DTBO to pvmfw without patching the host DT.",
