      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-27T07:02:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, I was referring to [these flags](http://cs/android/packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/config.rs;l\u003d34;rcl\u003d8b6fca65c6a2731d31d76123edb8e91a0b07d82a) but I agree that adding a check on ABL based on something ABL needs to set isn\u0027t _much_ more solid (more of a best attempt at sanity checking) but what else could pvmfw do?\n\nIt _should_ also be possible to parse the BCC and check which DICE mode ABL has used to sign pvmfw.",
